---
---

<section style="background-color: #111111;" class="py-20 px-6 md:px-10">
  <div class="max-w-content mx-auto">
    <p class="occhiello mb-4" style="color: #A65A3A;">Newsletter</p>
    <h2
      style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight: 300; font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #F5F1EA; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"
    >
      Non perderti nessun articolo
    </h2>
    <p
      style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; color: #D8C7B8; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 45ch;"
    >
      Divulgazione tessile direttamente nella tua casella di posta. Senza spam, solo contenuti di qualità.
    </p>
    <form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 max-w-md" onsubmit="return false;">
      <input
        type="email"
        placeholder="La tua email"
        required
        style="flex: 1; padding: 12px 16px; background: transparent; border: 0.5px solid #A9A29A; color: #F5F1EA; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s;"
        onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#A65A3A'"
        onblur="this.style.borderColor='#A9A29A'"
      />
      <button
        type="submit"
        class="occhiello transition-colors duration-200 hover:opacity-90"
        style="padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #A65A3A; color: #F5F1EA; font-size: 11px; white-space: nowrap; border: none; cursor: pointer;"
      >
        Iscriviti
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
